1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,820
Keyword: Revive

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:05,620
Heroes with Revive return to life
after their first death,

3
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,760
recovering 50% of their Health.

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:11,440
Heroes without innate Revive
can gain it too,

5
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,960
through Taiyi Zhenren,

6
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:17,800
Sage's Sanctuary equipment
or certain talents.

7
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,200
Heroes that already have Revive

8
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,812
can stack extra uses through these effects
to revive multiple times.
